Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,You don't need a new\Nstrategy. You need to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:06.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,know if you {\c&H1EB0F2&}followed{\c&HFAF7F5&} the\Nlast one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:09.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Most beginners {\c&H1EB0F2&}switch{\c&HFAF7F5&}\Nevery two weeks. New
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:11.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,indicator. New video.\NNew system.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:15.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,So they never find out\Nif the old one worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:19.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,If you follow a strategy\Nfifty percent of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:21.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,time, you haven't {\c&H1EB0F2&}tested{\c&HFAF7F5&}\Nit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:24.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Before you switch,\Njournal {\c&H1EB0F2&}twenty{\c&HFAF7F5&} trades
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:27.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,with one setup. Tag\Nevery rule break.
